From 7dec23368a3b1dfc98bc0ab550c9b7ce7e402f4d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: jinghero <44921326+jinghero@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 13:08:19 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 093/101] media: release owned decoder sessions on context
 replacement

The address-space device clears old contexts before restoring a snapshot. Delete the plugins still in each manager so their generic destructors return queued textures and deinitialize the codec. Free the per-size pool lists when the texture pool itself is destroyed.

Keep the H.264 implementation declaration alongside its HEVC counterpart. The pinned companion header defaults its destructor inline.
